  "steps[k] is the distribution after the prompt plus the first k greedy tokens: top_ids[0] is greedy_ids[k].",
  "the generation ran past <|im_end|> (248046, the chat's end) and <|endoftext|> (248044, config.json's eos_token_id) on purpose: stop at either in a chat.",
  "hidden_last_position (prompt 'plain', the prompt's last token): 'embeddings' is the token embedding, 'layer k' the residual stream after decoder layer k, except that the last entry (layer 23) is after the final RMSNorm, as transformers returns it.",
  "computed in float32 on the CPU; a GPU in float32 with bf16 weights should give the same greedy ids, with logits within a few hundredths; top-2 margins below about 0.05 can flip."
 ]
